; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
; regression.script -- the standing Windows 98 / Voodoo 2 regression.
;
; Copy it beside w98glide.exe AS input.script and run:
;
;     w98glide.exe 4000            with sound
;     w98glide.exe 4000 recwav     record the mix to mix.wav instead of playing it
;
; Every screenshot it takes is a thing that has broken at least once. Read them; a pass
; that draws nothing looks exactly like a pass that is switched off.
; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

; --- the TITLE SCREEN, which the game now boots to. Everything after this is offset by
;     the menu click, so the frame numbers below moved when the menu landed.
20    shot r00_menu.bmp
30    move 320 100
34    lb 1
44    lb 0
; --- the briefing movie plays next. Let a few frames of it run, photograph it, then
;     skip it the way a player would.
120   shot r00b_briefing.bmp
150   key SPACE 3

; --- the opening frame: HUD chassis, radar plate, empty wells, shroud over an unexplored map
200   shot r01_start.bmp

; --- select the MCV and deploy it. The engine decides what "the default action here"
;     means, and for an MCV on its own cell that is deploy.
230    move 340 150
232    lb 1
240    lb 0
270   key D 3
570   shot r02_deployed.bmp

; --- click the first build cameo. The cell should show the cameo under a build clock,
;     the credits should start falling and the power meter should light.
600   move 528 232
604   lb 1
612   lb 0
870   shot r03_building.bmp

; --- hover REPAIR, then SELL, then the scroll arrows: every control has a hover frame
;     and the bar only recomposes when one of them changes.
910   move 514 195
950   shot r04_hover_repair.bmp
970   move 568 195
1010   shot r05_hover_sell.bmp

; --- the minimap. Clicking it moves the camera, which is the only quick way across a
;     64 cell map with no edge scroll.
1050   move 550 90
1054   lb 1
1062   lb 0
1110   shot r06_radar_click.bmp

; --- a band select over the field, then a right-click order.
1170  move 260 150
1174  lb 1
1190  move 400 260
1210  shot r07_band.bmp
1230  lb 0
1270  move 200 300
1274  rb 1
1282  rb 0
1370  shot r08_ordered.bmp

; --- scroll hard in every direction and through the zoom range. This is the pattern
;     that wedged the card twice; it must survive it.
1420  key LEFT 90
1520  key UP 90
1620  key RIGHT 120
1750  key DOWN 120
1880  key LEFT 60
1950  key PGUP 2
1990  key PGDN 2
2070  shot r09_scrolled.bmp

; --- back to the base and let the mission run: sound events, tiberium growth, the AI.
2120  cam 56 56
3570  shot r10_late.bmp

; --- both mission-end banners. A scripted run cannot play a mission to its real end, so
;     these are forced; the banner is still the engine's own art through the real path.
3670  over 1
3730  shot r11_won.bmp
3770  over 0
3830  shot r12_lost.bmp
3870  quit
